<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>I am so glad that God made my hair,</l><l>My head’s growing hair! Just look right up there!</l><l>For cov’ring and warmth—it’s God’s loving care;</l><l>Thank You, Lord, for my hair!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>We are so glad that God made our knees;</l><l>Bending our knees, we can climb trees!</l><l>Running and jumping with knees is a breeze!</l><l>Thank You, Lord, for our knees!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Aren’t you so glad that God made your thumb,</l><l>To pick up a crumb and also a plum!</l><l>On your guitar to pick or to strum—</l><l>Thank You, Lord, for our thumbs!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
